 * `dv_cache_clear()` gains `source = c("all", "worms", "gbif")`.
+* WoRMS ranks with a qualifier, such as `"Phylum (Division)"` for plants and
+  algae, are now read: Chlorophyta and other plant taxa keep their phylum.
